1️⃣ Class Diagram

The system has three classes:

1. Student
2. Subject
3. GradeCalculator

Structure:

+-------------------+        +-------------------+        +-------------------+
|     Student       |        |     Subject       |        |  GradeCalculator  |
+-------------------+        +-------------------+        +-------------------+
| - name: String    |        | - name: String    |        |                   |
| - subjects: List  |<>----->| - marks: int      |        |                   |
+-------------------+        +-------------------+        +-------------------+
| + getName()       |        | + getName()       |        | + calculateGrade() |
| + getSubjects()   |        | + getMarks()      |        |                   |
+-------------------+        +-------------------+        +-------------------+

